{% doc %}
  @prompt
    任务： 请为产品详情页（Product Page）创建一个名为 "Advanced Sticky Add to Cart" 的 Liquid Section，要求具备以下极高自由度的自定义设置（Schema Settings）：
    
    1. 核心交互逻辑：
    
    触发机制： 初始状态隐藏。使用 JavaScript 监听滚动，仅当用户向下滚动到看不见页面原本的“加入购物车”按钮时，该版块才以 position: fixed 固定在页面底部弹出。
    
    点击反馈： 加购按钮在点击时必须触发 transform: scale(1.3) 并带有 opacity: 0.5 的瞬时反馈动画。
    
    2. 布局结构 (Flexbox)：
    
    左侧： 自动抓取产品主图（保持比例，高度限制 50px），右侧紧跟当前选中的变体名称（Variant Title）。
    
    右侧： 放置加购按钮，文案调用 products.product.add_to_cart。
    
    3. 必须包含的自定义设置项 (Schema Settings)：
    请在 Schema 中提供以下配置滑块或颜色选择器：
    
    容器背景： 颜色选择器（支持透明度，默认 rgba(255,255,255,0.2)）及毛玻璃模糊度（0-20px 调节）。
    
    边框控制： 边框颜色（默认 rgba(255,255,255,0.4)）、边框粗细（0-5px）、边框圆角（0-50px）。
    
    阴影效果： 允许开关阴影，并调节阴影的模糊范围。
    
    按钮颜色： 独立设置按钮的【背景色】和【文字颜色】。
    
    按钮字体： 调节按钮字体大小（12-24px）和字重（Light/Normal/Bold）。
    
    按钮圆角： 独立调节按钮的圆角半径（0-50px）。
    
    间距调节： 允许设置整个版块的【上下内边距 Padding】和【左右内边距】。
    
    位置调节： 允许设置该版块距离页面底部的间距（Bottom offset），以防遮挡聊天插件。
    
    文本颜色： 独立设置产品标题和变体文字的颜色（默认 #000 和 #666）。
    
    4. 样式规范：
    
    使用 backdrop-filter: blur(10px) 实现毛玻璃效果。
    
    默认配色：主色 #000，辅助色 #fff，副标题 #666。
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-sticky-atc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    position: fixed;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.bottom_offset }}px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 999;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(100%);
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, visibility 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-sticky-atc-visible-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.container_bg_color }};
    backdrop-filter: blur({{ block.settings.blur_intensity }}px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur({{ block.settings.blur_intensity }}px);
    border: {{ block.settings.border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    {% if block.settings.enable_shadow %}
      box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur | times: 2 }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-details-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-variant-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.variant_color }};
    margin: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
  }

  .ai-sticky-atc-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
    transform: scale(1.3);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-sticky-atc-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: 0;
      border-left: none;
      border-right: none;
    }

    .ai-sticky-atc-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .ai-sticky-atc-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .ai-sticky-atc-variant-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .ai-sticky-atc-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size | minus: 2 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<sticky-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-sticky-atc-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-sticky-atc-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-sticky-atc-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-sticky-atc-product-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-sticky-atc-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if product.featured_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 100 }}"
              alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
              width="50"
              height="50"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-sticky-atc-details-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <h3 class="ai-sticky-atc-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
          <p class="ai-sticky-atc-variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-variant-title>
            {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
              {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.title }}
            {% endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="ai-sticky-atc-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        data-add-to-cart
      >
        {{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</sticky-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class StickyAddToCart{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.originalAddToCartButton = null;
        this.isVisible = false;
        this.variantTitleElement = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.variantTitleElement = this.querySelector('[data-variant-title]');
        this.addToCartButton = this.querySelector('[data-add-to-cart]');
        
        this.findOriginalButton();
        this.setupScrollListener();
        this.setupClickListener();
        this.setupVariantChangeListener();
      }

      findOriginalButton() {
        const productForm = document.querySelector('product-form');
        if (productForm) {
          this.originalAddToCartButton = productForm.querySelector('[name="add"]');
        }
      }

      setupScrollListener() {
        let ticking = false;
        
        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          if (!ticking) {
            window.requestAnimationFrame(() => {
              this.handleScroll();
              ticking = false;
            });
            ticking = true;
          }
        });
        
        this.handleScroll();
      }

      handleScroll() {
        if (!this.originalAddToCartButton) {
          this.findOriginalButton();
          if (!this.originalAddToCartButton) return;
        }

        const buttonRect = this.originalAddToCartButton.getBoundingClientRect();
        const isButtonVisible = buttonRect.top < window.innerHeight && buttonRect.bottom > 0;

        if (!isButtonVisible && !this.isVisible) {
          this.classList.add('ai-sticky-atc-visible-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          this.isVisible = true;
        } else if (isButtonVisible && this.isVisible) {
          this.classList.remove('ai-sticky-atc-visible-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          this.isVisible = false;
        }
      }

      setupClickListener() {
        this.addToCartButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
          if (this.originalAddToCartButton) {
            this.originalAddToCartButton.click();
          }
        });
      }

      setupVariantChangeListener() {
        const productForm = document.querySelector('product-form');
        if (!productForm) return;

        const variantSelects = productForm.querySelectorAll('variant-selects, variant-radios');
        
        variantSelects.forEach(variantSelector => {
          const observer = new MutationObserver(() => {
            this.updateVariantTitle();
          });

          observer.observe(variantSelector, {
            childList: true,
            subtree: true,
            attributes: true
          });
        });

        document.addEventListener('variant:change', () => {
          this.updateVariantTitle();
        });
      }

      updateVariantTitle() {
        const productForm = document.querySelector('product-form');
        if (!productForm) return;

        const variantInput = productForm.querySelector('[name="id"]');
        if (!variantInput) return;

        const variantId = variantInput.value;
        
        fetch(window.location.pathname + '?variant=' + variantId)
          .then(response => response.text())
          .then(html => {
            const parser = new DOMParser();
            const doc = parser.parseFromString(html, 'text/html');
            const variantTitle = doc.querySelector('.product-form__input input[name="id"]');
            
            if (variantTitle) {
              const selectedOption = doc.querySelector('.product-form__input option[selected], .product-form__input option:checked');
              if (selectedOption && selectedOption.textContent.trim() !== 'Default Title') {
                this.variantTitleElement.textContent = selectedOption.textContent.trim();
              } else {
                this.variantTitleElement.textContent = '';
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(error => {
            console.error('Error updating variant title:', error);
          });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('sticky-add-to-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}', StickyAddToCart{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sticky add to cart",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "ai-sticky-add-to-cart-block",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Container style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "container_bg_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "blur_intensity",
      "label": "Blur intensity",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "border_color",
      "label": "Border color",
      "default": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "border_width",
      "label": "Border width",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 5,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "border_radius",
      "label": "Border radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_shadow",
      "label": "Enable shadow",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "shadow_blur",
      "label": "Shadow blur",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_vertical",
      "label": "Vertical padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_horizontal",
      "label": "Horizontal padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "bottom_offset",
      "label": "Bottom offset",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Text colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "title_color",
      "label": "Product title color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "variant_color",
      "label": "Variant text color",
      "default": "#666666"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Button style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_bg_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_hover_bg_color",
      "label": "Hover background color",
      "default": "#333333"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_font_size",
      "label": "Font size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 14
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "button_font_weight",
      "label": "Font weight",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "300",
          "label": "Light"
        },
        {
          "value": "400",
          "label": "Normal"
        },
        {
          "value": "700",
          "label": "Bold"
        }
      ],
      "default": "400"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_border_radius",
      "label": "Border radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 8
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Sticky add to cart"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
